# Through the secret wall to the Ambush A room (Imperial Prison). Renote reaches marker C (stage 20); once the player
# is near the Emperor's marker CharGenQuest sets 22 and the Mythic Dawn assassins attack (23); they kill Renote (24);
# when the four assassins are dead the quest sets 26, the Emperor and Baurus talk (27), Glenroy/Baurus/Emperor talk
# (28), Baurus warns the player not to follow (29).

# The player follows the Emperor's group down the passage; moveto stands in for the walk. Stage 22 needs the player
# within 480 of CGMarkerCEmperor or 900 of CGMarkerC2Renote, so the player is moved next to the ambush room markers.
case ambush_a_arrive
until 3600 GetStage Charactergen >= 20
run
player.moveto CGMarkerC2Renote
until 900 GetStage Charactergen >= 22
end

# The assassins reach the floor marker and fight (23); they kill Renote (CGRenoteScript OnHit CGAssassinNN sets 24).
case ambush_a_assassins_attack
until 1800 GetStage Charactergen >= 23
until 1800 GetStage Charactergen >= 24
expect RenoteRef.GetDead
end

# The player finishes the assassins the Blades have not killed (kill stands in for the fight). The assassins' OnDeath
# scripts count ambushCount; at four dead the quest sets 26.
case ambush_a_kill_assassins
run
CGAssassin01Ref.kill
CGAssassin02Ref.kill
CGAssassin03Ref.kill
CGAssassin04Ref.kill
until 900 GetStage Charactergen >= 26
end

# Baurus and the Emperor talk (INFO 0005144A, stage 27), then Glenroy/Baurus/Emperor (INFO 00015135, stage 28). The
# player stays in the room, within 800 of Baurus: he warns the player not to follow and the quest sets 29.
case ambush_a_baurus_warns
until 3600 GetStage Charactergen >= 27
until 3600 GetStage Charactergen >= 28
until 3600 GetStage Charactergen >= 29
end
